{"schema_version":"1.55","kind":"thread","sections":["Context"],"body_template":"\n# Thread: \u003ctitle\u003e\n\n**Goal.** \u003cgoal\u003e\n\n## Context\n\n\u003cwhy this initiative exists, important constraints, and decisions that do not belong on one task\u003e\n","fields":[{"name":"description","type":"string","required":true,"description":"One line summarizing the initiative (≤200 chars).","example":"Consolidate configuration lifecycle into one hub"},{"name":"goal","type":"string","required":true,"description":"One-line observable finish line for the initiative.","example":"Ship unified config CLI and TUI routes"},{"name":"target_date","type":"date","required":false,"description":"Optional human planning target, not a calculated forecast.","example":"2026-09-01"},{"name":"tags","type":"list","required":false,"description":"Topical tags.","example":"[cli, tui, config]"},{"name":"tasks","type":"list","required":false,"description":"Sorted stable task-ID membership set; list order has no execution meaning.","example":"[6fjangd7kvh0, 6fjangd7kvh1]"}],"conventions":["creation always persists unstarted; use thread lifecycle verbs for later status changes.","tasks contains stable task IDs only, is stored sorted without duplicates, and owns membership rather than dependency edges.","task files own the repository-global depends_on relation; Thread frontier, gates, and progress are runtime projections."],"templates":[{"kind":"thread","name":"default","description":"Standard Thread scaffold: context and constraints for the initiative."}]}
